sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SM as Sotuv menejeri
    participant UI as React (brauzer)
    participant API as Django REST API<br/>(EC2: nginx → gunicorn)
    participant SVC as services.py
    participant DB as Amazon RDS<br/>PostgreSQL
    participant S3 as Amazon S3

    SM->>UI: Katalogda "Sotish" → mijoz, narx
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/orders/ (JWT)
    API->>API: JWT + rol/filial ruxsatini tekshirish
    API->>SVC: create_order(data, items)
    activate SVC
    SVC->>DB: BEGIN, SELECT ... FOR UPDATE (inventory)
    alt Qoldiq yetarli
        SVC->>DB: INSERT order + order_item, UPDATE stock (status = reserved)
        SVC->>DB: COMMIT
        SVC-->>API: Order
        API-->>UI: 201 Created
        UI-->>SM: Kanban'da "Kutilmoqda" ustunida
    else Qoldiq yetarli emas / sotilgan
        SVC->>DB: ROLLBACK
        API-->>UI: 400 "omborda yetarli qoldiq yo'q"
    end
    deactivate SVC

    SM->>UI: Kartochkada "📄 Invoice"
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/orders/{id}/invoice/
    API->>DB: Buyurtma va pozitsiyalarni o'qish
    API->>API: ReportLab bilan PDF yaratish
    API->>S3: PutObject lamboerp/documents/... (IAM role, SSE-S3)
    API->>DB: INSERT document
    API-->>UI: 201 Document
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/documents/{id}/download/
    API->>S3: GetObject
    S3-->>API: PDF
    API-->>UI: PDF fayl (attachment)
    UI-->>SM: invoice-00001.pdf yuklab olindi
